# Copy to `.env.local` and adjust. Only variables prefixed with VITE_ reach the
# browser bundle — never put a secret in here.

# Base URL of the API, INCLUDING the version segment.
#
# Local dev: leave this commented out. The app defaults to `/api/v1` and
# vite.config.ts proxies /api -> http://localhost:8000, so there are no CORS
# issues and no need to restart when the backend port changes.
#
# Production (Vercel): set this to the deployed FastAPI origin.
# VITE_API_URL=https://civic-api.onrender.com/api/v1
